mperor's will with ruthless zeal and efficiency. Stormtroopers are a separate force from the troops of the Imperial Forces and do not answer directly to Imperial military officers. They are obedient and are devoted to the Emperor. They cannot be bribed, blackmailed, or seduced. Any such attempt automatically fails.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After recognizing the need for troopers with special equipment and training, the Emperor ordered the development of additional types of Stormtroopers. Including (but not limited to) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Snowtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Snowtroopers"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sandtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sandtroopers"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout_Troopers"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Legacy Era"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though not a trait exclusive to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Fel Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Fel_Empire","referenceId":"reference:45bef1c82bffe9c1"},", Stormtroopers in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Era"}," can be of any number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},", and the Empire recruits both male and female troopers. This new breed of Stormtroopers, hailing from hundreds of different worlds throughout the Empire, seems to be more common in Roan Fel's Empire-in-Exile than in Darth Krayt's Empire, but only because the Fel dynasty has gone out of its way to draw members of other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"